      "question": "The remainder when $7^{103}$ is divided by 25 is",
      "options": [
        "18",
        "7",
        "1",
        "24"
      ],
      "finalAnswer": "(a) 18",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "$7^{103} = 7 \\cdot (7^2)^{51} = 7(49)^{51} = 7(50-1)^{51}$.",
        "Expansion: $7(^{51}C_0 50^{51} - dots - ^{51}C_{51} 1^{51})$.",
        "$7(50k - 1) = 350k - 7$.",
        "$350k - 7 = 350k - 25 + 18$. Remainder is 18."
      ]
    },
